1166803319226634240093621.jpeg/CAMftKgaZ12DdAwYRaNShKElO_ElsM8NYsAbtGLAG7Q\"/><figcaption>博主視頻評論區下暖心的留言。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有留學生在比華利山開美甲店創業。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260819/1166804193386696704364719.jpeg/fu2TK3zSkKQj3AT93OxCHj6VQwDg_SCwQ12sMUNdrDE\"/><figcaption>有留學生在比華利山開美甲店創業。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"橙子成功把興趣變成事業。（小紅書@麪包超人rdh）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260819/1166802496513904640729801.jpeg/pg7vWANn9bhTsdl2iwHA_QKemZhd62Zs1Be7a9QXu2s\"/><figcaption>橙子成功把興趣變成事業。（小紅書@麪包超人rdh）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文獲「Panopath留學過來人」授權轉載，微信公眾號：Panopath_liuxue】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-27T14:38:48.178786+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":5021,"images":31,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}